# Delete refusals: the caller itself (403), an unknown id (404), a sole appointment assignee (422, nothing deleted),
# and the same mechanic once a second one is assigned (200, the appointment keeps the other mechanic).

# Not reachable: an admin target (403) needs a second admin, which no API or bootstrap path creates.
# Not reachable: "last remaining mechanic" (422), because the admin is a mechanic and the target is always a non-admin.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@TestPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@SoleEmail = delete.mechanic.sole.{{RunId}}@example.test
@CustomerEmail = delete.mechanic.customer.{{RunId}}@example.test
@UnknownMechanicId = 999999

### [Setup][Admin] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204, 401 or 403, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Admin] Login as admin (200 expected)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][Admin] Admin cannot delete the own account (403 expected, stable detail)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{adminLogin.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail == "Administrators cannot delete their own account.") == true

###

### [Positive][Admin] The refused self-delete left the admin session alive (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.isAdmin == true

###

### [Negative][Admin] Cannot delete an unknown mechanic (404 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{UnknownMechanicId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 404
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail == "Mechanic not found.") == true

###

### [Negative][Admin] A non-numeric id does not match the int route (404 expected, never 500)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/abc
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 404

###

### [Setup][Admin] Create a disposable customer (201 expected)
# @name customer
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Delete", "middleName": null, "lastName": "Invariant", "email": "{{CustomerEmail}}", "phoneNumber": null }

?? status == 201

###

### [Setup][Admin] Create the customer's vehicle (201 expected)
# @name vehicle
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customer.id}}/vehicles
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "licensePlate": "DMI-{{RunId}}", "vin": "TST{{RunId.toString().slice(-10)}}0501", "brand": "Skoda", "model": "Octavia", "year": 2020, "mileageKm": 45000, "enginePowerKw": 110, "drivetrainType": "Petrol" }

?? status == 201

###

### [Setup][Admin] Register the disposable mechanic that becomes the sole assignee (200 expected)
# @name soleMechanic
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Delete", "lastName": "SoleAssignment", "email": "{{SoleEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Admin] Create an appointment assigned only to that mechanic (201 expected)
# @name soleAppointment
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customer.id}}/appointments
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": {{vehicle.id}}, "scheduledDate": "2026-04-18T10:30:00", "taskDescription": "Delete invariant fixture", "mechanicIds": [{{soleMechanic.personId}}] }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.mechanics.length == 1

###

### [Negative][Admin] Deleting the sole assignee is refused (422 expected, stable detail)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{soleMechanic.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail == "Cannot delete this mechanic because one or more appointments would be left without assigned mechanics.") == true

###

### [Positive][Admin] The refused delete changed nothing: the mechanic is still listed (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics?search={{SoleEmail}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.totalCount == 1
?? js (response.parsedBody.items[0].personId == soleMechanic.personId) == true

###

### [Setup][Admin] Assign the admin as a second mechanic (200 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{soleAppointment.id}}/assign/{{adminLogin.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Admin] With a second assignee the delete goes through (200 expected, message)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{soleMechanic.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.message == "Mechanic deleted successfully.") == true

###

### [Positive][Admin] The appointment survives with only the admin assigned (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customer.id}}/appointments

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 1
?? js response.parsedBody[0].mechanics.length == 1
?? js (response.parsedBody[0].mechanics[0].id == adminLogin.personId) == true

###

### [Cleanup][Admin] Delete the disposable customer with its vehicle and appointment (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customer.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Setup][Admin] Logout admin (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
